{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And it shall be</b> — This pericah is connected, for in the place where they were exiled there they will bear many children, only they do not fear HaShem." "And the meaning of והיה is \"in the place of,\" like תחת אשר לא עבדת (Hosea 2:9, \"instead that they did not serve\"). And the sense: they call themselves sons of El Hai (\"the Living God\"), but in truth they are לא עמי (\"not My people\"), on account of their evil deeds."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :register {:flags {1 ["God"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:42.962218604Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}